    ]]></notes>
    <packageUrl regex="true">^pkg:maven/org\.apache\.tomcat\.embed/tomcat\-embed\-core@.*$</packageUrl>
    <cve>CVE-2026-65637</cve>
  </suppress>

  <suppress>
    <notes><![CDATA[
      CATEGORY B (ACCEPTED RISK — no published fix). CVE-2026-68525, CVSS 9.1,
      Tomcat FORM authentication authorization bypass, range >=10.1.0 <10.1.58.
      GENUINELY APPLIES to tomcat-embed-core 10.1.57. Fixed release 10.1.58 is
