    ]]></notes>
    <packageUrl regex="true">^pkg:maven/org\.apache\.tomcat\.embed/tomcat\-embed\-core@.*$</packageUrl>
    <cve>CVE-2026-68525</cve>
  </suppress>

  <suppress>
    <notes><![CDATA[
      CATEGORY B (ACCEPTED RISK — no published fix). CVE-2026-65182, CVSS 9.1,
      security constraint bypass, range >=10.1.0 <10.1.58. GENUINELY APPLIES to
